      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The path focused on border enforcement and technology is the only viable long-term solution because it directly addresses the root cause of the crisis by securing our borders and deterring illegal entry. Relying on pathways to citizenship or humanitarian processing without first stopping the flow of undocumented migrants will only perpetuate a broken system that strains our economy and social fabric. We must prioritize enforcement to create the stability necessary for any other immigration policy to succeed.",
